## User

Remove duplicate elements from a list, keeping the first occurrence of each.

## Type

type
```haskell
dedup :: Eq a => [a] -> [a]
```

## Term

```haskell
dedup = go []
  where
    go :: Eq a => [a] -> [a] -> [a]
    go acc [] = acc
    go acc (x:xs) = go (x:acc) xs
```

